{"contract":"bw-jmdict-shard/3","entries":[{"accent":1,"common":false,"etymology":["按照古舊讀音 fuku，可能衍生自動詞吹く (fuku，“吹”)，大概來自這種魚吹沙找食物的模樣。或與動詞膨れる (fukureru，“膨脹、展開”)有關。","來自中古漢語 河豚 (中古 ha dwon, 字面意思為“河 + 豬”)。對照現代官話讀法 hétún 。"],"examples":[{"en":"He was poisoned by the globefish he ate.","ja":"彼はフグにあたった。","ref":"292583_111104","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Every rose has its thorns.","ja":"河豚は食いたし命は惜しし。","ref":"1636183_186769","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Blowfish is a delicacy in Japan.","ja":"フグは日本の珍味だ。","ref":"34370_197187","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["河豚","鰒","鮐","魨","鯸","鯺"],"glosses":["puffer fish","blow fish","fugu","globefish","swellfish"],"id":"1193570","lemma":"河豚","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"フグ","readings":["ふぐ","ふく","ふくべ","かとん","フグ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/河豚#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/河/河豚/河豚.html","https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/フグ#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/フ/フグ/フグ.html"],"synonyms":["鉄砲"],"zhGlosses":["河魨、豚魚，魨形目的魚類","sl胖而難看的女人","sl易怒且自大的人","sl槍 (“被槍擊中會死”，類比“吃了河魨會死”)","豚魚","河豚，鰒：一種魚類"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["河魨、豚魚，魨形目的魚類"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl胖而難看的女人"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl易怒且自大的人"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["sl槍 (“被槍擊中會死”，類比“吃了河魨會死”)"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["豚魚"],"pos":"n"},{"examples":[],"glosses":["河豚，鰒：一種魚類"],"pos":"n"}]},{"accent":0,"common":true,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"ja":"巨大な白いサメ。大きな口で噛みつかれたら逃れられない。","ref":"1999年 7月5日，「グレート・ホワイト [Great White]」，收錄於 BOOSTER 3，Konami：","source":"wty","zh":"A giant white shark. It is utterly impossible to get out of its gigantic biting jaw."},{"en":"Sharks are infamous for their bloodthirsty natures.","ja":"鮫はその血に飢えた残忍さで悪名高い。","ref":"244963_169524","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"However, I can't help noticing, at this moment, that at first glance it seems inevitable that the shark will devour the man.","ja":"しかし今は、一目見て、サメがその人