564","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Give me three pieces of salmon.","ja":"鮭を３切れ下さい。","ref":"244922_169565","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"The fish tasted like salmon.","ja":"その魚はさけのような味だった。","ref":"48712_211436","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Salmon lay their eggs in fresh water.","ja":"サケは淡水で産卵する。","ref":"54145_216838","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"This is a salmon that came up the river.","ja":"これはその川をのぼってきたサケです。","ref":"55907_218593","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["鮭"],"glosses":["salmon (Salmonidae spp.)","chum salmon (Oncorhynchus keta)","dog salmon"],"id":"1579300","lemma":"鮭","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"サケ","readings":["さけ","しゃけ","サケ","シャケ"]},{"accent":1,"common":false,"etymology":[],"examples":[{"en":"He looked into the farmer's smiling red face, \"Yes, sir.\" He said.","ja":"彼は農園主の微笑んでいる赤ら顔をじっと見て、「はい」と答えました。","ref":"302371_101325","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He thought to himself, \"No!\" Aloud he said, \"Yes.\"","ja":"彼は心の中で「いやだ！」と思ったが、声に出して言ったのは「はい」であった。","ref":"299832_103860","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"He told me when to say yes.","ja":"彼はいつ「はい」というべきか私に教えてくれた。","ref":"289019_114651","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"\"Come home early, Bill.\" \"Yes, Mother.\"","ja":"「早くいらっしゃい、ビル」「はい、おかあさん」","ref":"274509_139732","source":"tanaka"},{"en":"Please wait a moment. Yes, we have a reservation for you.","ja":"少々お待ち下さい。はい、確かに予約があります。","ref":"267905_146656","source":"tanaka"}],"forms":["鮠","鰷"],"glosses":["minnow","shinner"],"id":"1586010","lemma":"鮠","pos":["n"],"readingKata":"ハエ","readings":["はや","はえ","はい"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/鮠#Japanese","https://kaikki.org/zhwiktionary/All%20languages%20combined/meaning/鮠/鮠/鮠.html"],"synonyms":[],"zhGlosses":["雅羅魚"],"zhSenses":[{"examples":[],"glosses":["雅羅魚"],"pos":"char"}]},{"common":false,"etymology":["對照漢語 愛女／爱女 (àinǚ)。"],"examples":[],"forms":["鮎魚女","鮎並","愛女","鮎並女"],"glosses":["fat greenling (Hexagrammos otakii)"],"id":"1586090","lemma":"鮎魚女","pos":["n"],"readings":["あいなめ","アイナメ"],"sourceUrls":["https://zh.wiktionary.org/wiki/愛